lour]" /></inputs><outputs><output type="flag" name="Contains Colour" stage="Contains Colour" /></outputs><onsuccess>8ee84eda-d89e-44be-9a93-9d421c786b4a</onsuccess><code><![CDATA['First Validate the input colour
